===== Product Information ==============================
   Product:             ENABLE Enhanced North American Benchmark LExico
   Version:             2.0
   Version Date:        14-Apr-2000
   Product Type:        Data File, as in data base, spreadsheet macro, etc.
   Basic Distribution Policy (see License, below, for details):
      Public domain, freely distributable by all channels

   Product Description: ENABLE v. 2.0 Enhanced North American 
                        Benchmark LExicon Tournament level word list 
                        for Scrabble (tm) players, Y2K update. Public
                        Domain and free. More carefully researched 
                        list than the "DOOM/TWL98" list.
   Reason for version:  Y2K Update (millennial edition)

   Category:            Games; Board games; Scrabble
   Keywords:            Scrabble dictionary word list
