===== Information for Users ("READ-ME") ================

It is strongly recommended that the SUPP2K.ZIP supplementary archive be
obtained as it contains additional documentation for the ENABLE list.

SUPP2K.ZIP may be downloaded from:
http://personal.riverusers.com/~thegrendel/software.html


